<!--C7B8DAD34E10498EB9C5177FE175D3EA-->  <DESCRIPTION><![CDATA[Stores the full JSON payload that triggered the automatic task, or user-supplied parameter JSON for tasks created manually (Created Automatically = N), enabling complete workflow audit.]]></DESCRIPTION>
<!--C7B8DAD34E10498EB9C5177FE175D3EA-->  <HELP><![CDATA[This field keeps a JSON document related to the task’s origin:
-Automatic tasks – the Debezium/Kafka event (before, after, op, source, …) that matched the Task Type rule.
-Manual tasks – any parameter JSON entered by the user or UI when Created Automatically = N.

Use it to:
-Inspect the exact data change or parameters that launched the workflow.
-Debug filter or advanced-logic conditions.
-Reproduce the context when re-processing tasks.

The value is set on task creation and is rarely modified afterwards. Stored as plain text (JSON format); copy it to an external viewer for easier reading.]]></HELP>
